    "Sending to ^[%lld device](inflect: true) — you can lock your phone now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "جارٍ الإرسال إلى ^[%lld جهاز](inflect: true) — يمكنك قفل هاتفك الآن."
